    "present",
    "presente",
    "conjugation",
    "-ar",
    "-er",
    "-ir"
   ],
   "rule": "Drop -ar, -er or -ir and add the ending for the person.",
   "text": "The present covers habits, facts and plans for the near future. For \"right now\", use **estar + gerund** (-ando / -iendo): estoy comiendo, está lloviendo.",
   "tables": [
