   "rule": "The stressed vowel of the stem changes in every form except nosotros and vosotros.",
   "text": "Other common ones: **e → ie** empezar, querer, preferir, entender, cerrar; **o → ue** poder, volver, encontrar, costar, recordar (and **jugar: u → ue**); **e → i** servir, repetir, seguir, vestir.",
