   "rule": "Literally \"it pleases me\": the verb agrees with the thing liked, and the person is an indirect object.",
   "text": "The same pattern: **encantar** (love), **interesar**, **importar**, **doler** (hurt), **faltar** (be missing), **parecer** (seem). Add **a + name** to make le/les clear: A Ana le gusta leer.",
