    "su",
    "este",
    "ese",
    "aquel"
   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "**Su** can mean his, her, their or your; add de él / de ella / de usted if it's unclear. After the noun there are long forms: un amigo **mío** (a friend of mine), **Es mío.** (It's mine.) Plurals: estos, estas, esos, esas, aquellos, aquellas.",
